{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/onboarding/layout,_N_T_/onboarding/page,_N_T_/onboarding"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--lEumuof_GfEtWVTZSjWDG--><html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark __variable_17031a __variable_c2c3d1 __variable_967564\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/0a86735c6520d94f-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/36ef2834916397d3-s.p.ttf\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/ttf\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/49d2f31d75dd11b6-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/91a8d5250c2f2545-s.p.ttf\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/ttf\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f47c4580da509d27.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/b39499bc-5a3d39d43e1fe6cb.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9311-340498c9694e41f2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-1f3f35e1ff696209.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1859-70651bf18819b8bd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/onboarding/page-fe3350074504a8a8.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Onboarding · Undate</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"A quiet, considered place to meet someone. Undate pairs thoughtful psychological profiling with hand-curated introductions.\"/><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Undate\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Intentional matchmaking for the people who know what they want.\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Undate\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Intentional matchmaking for the people who know what they want.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/undate-logo.png\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen bg-ink-900 text-cream-50 font-sans antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-14\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-baseline font-serif lowercase leading-none tracking-tight \" style=\"font-size:28px\" aria-label=\"Undate\"><span class=\"relative text-cream-50/75\">un<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute left-[-3%] right-[-3%] top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full bg-gold-500\" style=\"height:1.5px\"></span></span><span class=\"text-gold-500\">date</span></span><span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-cream-50/50\">Your onboarding</span></div><h1 class=\"mt-8 font-display text-4xl tracking-tight text-cream-50\">Let&#x27;s get to know you, properly.</h1><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-xl text-cream-50/70\">Instead of a form, you&#x27;ll have one short, natural conversation with your Undate matchmaker. It never asks you to rate yourself, it simply listens, the way a good friend would, and quietly builds your profile.</p><section class=\"mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-cream-50/10 bg-ink-700/50 p-6\"><p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-gold-700\">What your matchmaker explores</p><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-cream-50\">The Big Five (OCEAN)<!-- -->.</span> <span class=\"text-cream-50/65\">Openness, conscientiousness, extraversion, agreeableness and emotional steadiness, the trait model that actually holds up in the research.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-cream-50\">Attachment &amp; values<!-- -->.</span> <span class=\"text-cream-50/65\">How you handle closeness, and the handful of things you build a life around, the strongest signals for ruling out a mismatch.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-cream-50\">Intentions &amp; dealbreakers<!-- -->.</span> <span class=\"text-cream-50/65\">What you actually want, and whether children are part of the picture.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-cream-50\">Conversation style<!-- -->.</span> <span class=\"text-cream-50/65\">Direct, gentle, playful, reflective or analytical, a gentle nudge, never a filter.</span></span></li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-500\"></span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-cream-50\">A personality type, for flavor<!-- -->.</span> <span class=\"text-cream-50/65\">We will tag you with a familiar Myers-Briggs label (e.g. INFJ) because it is fun, but the real work above is what drives your matches.</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-cream-50/45\">Private by design: we never infer or store religion, health, ethnicity, or orientation, and the AI can&#x27;t be talked into a particular score.</p></section><h2 class=\"mt-12 font-display text-2xl tracking-tight text-cream-50\">Choose how you&#x27;d like to do it</h2><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-cream-50/10 bg-ink-900 p-7 shadow-soft transition-colors hover:border-gold-500/50\" href=\"/onboarding/voice\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-500/15 text-gold-700\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path><path d=\"M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2M12 19v4M8 23h8\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-cream-50\">Talk it out</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-50/65\">A voice chat with no time limit, like ranting to a friend. Speak your answers; your matchmaker talks back. Take as long as you want, the more you share, the better we match.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm text-gold-700 group-hover:text-gold-500\">Start the voice chat →</span></a><a class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-cream-50/10 bg-ink-900 p-7 shadow-soft transition-colors hover:border-gold-500/50\" href=\"/onboarding/chat\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-500/15 text-gold-700\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-xl tracking-tight text-cream-50\">Type it out</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream-50/65\">Prefer to write? Have the same conversation by text, at your own pace, whenever you like.</p><span class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm text-gold-700 group-hover:text-gold-500\">Start the chat →</span></a></div><p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-xs text-cream-50/45\">In a hurry?<!-- --> <a class=\"text-cream-50/70 underline hover:text-cream-50\" href=\"/onboarding/classic\">Use the quick form instead</a>.</p></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-f47c4580da509d27.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[9278,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n3:I[9844,[],\\\"\\\"]\\ne:I[1030,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/0a86735c6520d94f-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/36ef2834916397d3-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/49d2f31d75dd11b6-s.p.woff2\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/woff2\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/media/91a8d5250c2f2545-s.p.ttf\\\",\\\"font\\\",{\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"font/ttf\\\"}]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"b\\\":\\\"lEumuof_GfEtWVTZSjWDG\\\",\\\"p\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"onboarding\\\"],\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"onboarding\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",true],[\\\"\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/css/4d447ae7efe7d7c5.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}]],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"html\\\",null,{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"dark __variable_17031a __variable_c2c3d1 __variable_967564\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"body\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"min-h-screen bg-ink-900 text-cream-50 font-sans antialiased\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2\\\",null,{\\\"parallelRouterKey\\\":\\\"children\\\",\\\"error\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorStyles\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"errorScripts\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"template\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L3\\\",null,{}],\\\"templa